; Triton v1.0 — Optimization Template
; Thesis: AUDUSD Long — Breakout Continuation
; Regime: 4-month consolidation broken, weekly MACD bullish crossover, target 0.6940
; Direction: LONG ONLY (fixed)
; Chart TF: M1
; BT: 2025.12.01 – 2026.03.01 | FT: 2026.03.01 – 2026.05.01
; Kill: China PMI drops hard, or risk-off shock
;
; PHILOSOPHY: Ranges as close to original ArchangelX as possible.
; Only change: TradeDirection locked LONG. Filter starting values biased
; toward breakout regime (EMA on, ADX on, BB off) but optimizer can override.
;
